{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_st03",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_st03",
  "title": "慈光引導",
  "storyCode": "HE-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0d37e8a3e47591ebc4c4afacd9a4bbb5d175f62f6805e0301107875e0b7effcf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，那邊那個長翅膀的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在喊你......喂！別走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假設長翅膀是對薩科塔的稱呼，這裡存在多個形象符合的人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喊的就是你。我知道你叫費德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，你這傢伙真擅長讓人發火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒工夫和你廢話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那個叫奧倫的傢伙......\n他告訴我杰拉爾德老大他、他為了我們，為了我和福爾圖娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是真的嗎？！杰拉爾德老大他真的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，杰拉爾德已經死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒有這麼不想聽到肯定回答的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我搞不懂啊......這怎麼可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我很抱歉，但這是事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......你有什麼可抱歉的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你離我遠點，長翅膀的。最好把眼睛閉上，不許看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是眼睛有點痛，你們的光環太刺眼了，只是這樣，一會就會好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杰拉爾德老大把匕首交給你，那是他的選擇，我......沒權利否定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我不能讓你就這麼把它帶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說你不知道，接下一個薩卡茲雇傭兵的武器意味著什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名號的傳承。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。所以......連同杰拉爾德老大、連同杰拉爾德的名字，還有他的尊嚴一起，我會全部從你那裡奪回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要向你挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會贏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必須要贏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要我還活著，我總會找到你，挑戰你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可別太小看我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拒絕你的挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？！你竟然拒絕？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都這樣向你挑戰了，你這傢伙——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杰拉爾德只是一名獵戶，我這裡的匕首不存在任何繼承上的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "字面意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你想要的是一柄繼承薩卡茲雇傭兵名字的匕首，我並未持有這樣一件物品，向我挑戰只是浪費你的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你想要的是獵戶杰拉爾德的匕首，那麼它確實被存放在我這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這傢伙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在就給你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......開什麼玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可是杰拉爾德老大最寶貝的武器，就這麼輕易到我手上，杰拉爾德老大一定也不會同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你給我把它收好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你等著......我會像杰拉爾德老大一樣，帶著我們的人找到一條新的出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到那時候，我才有資格接下它。我會再回來找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那之前，我會替你保管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g8_outsidepath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊蒙德......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別看了，我覺得他應該能撐得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是你，你之前說已經無法再握銃，但現在卻......在祈禱嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我總覺得，它還會回應我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——斯普莉雅，我還能繼續用這把銃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能啊，怎麼不能，雖然這把銃看起來有點舊，但你可以相信我的手藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來是要去研究遺產銃的哦，那可都是些老古董。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過最近我越來越覺得......還是新鮮的事情更有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新鮮的事情......你不覺得害怕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "害怕也沒用嘛，害怕也還是會想去瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "技術要為人所用，這是學姐曾經和我說過的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候我其實沒太明白，不過現在嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多少明白一點了吧。我是個工匠，我得對從我手上出來的武器負責......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，不提這個，你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位準備和薩卡茲一起離開的女士？你的準備工作都做好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......！你、你已經猜到我要跟你說什麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我不能直接感覺到，但你的心思可比一些能共感的薩科塔還容易猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼一想，沒有共感也確實沒什麼大不了的，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你是打算乖乖回拉特蘭的話，可不會在這個時間鄭重其事地來找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前明明答應過你，我會服從你們的看管，接受我應得的懲罰......現在我卻想逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所、所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我會不會放過你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你猜猜看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。你的身份還挺麻煩的，進入拉特蘭城的話就得一直戴著兜帽生活了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然還是不行嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，在別的地方也好不了多少，至少上面是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的角，你的樣貌和你的銃，都不可以讓太多人看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後呢，我依然是你的監管人。無論你接下來要去哪裡定居，只要你還活著，就要和我保持聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會給我添麻煩的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊，嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要放我走？那、那你怎麼辦？你放我走，不會被責怪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，最壞的情況就是從教皇廳辭職嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊，我剛剛開玩笑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這次回去確實得為一些事情寫報告了，要是寫得不開心了，我再考慮要不要辭職吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之呢，現在你欠我的不止是一份青草格子餅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的......我......真的很感激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......還可以算是同族嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，這個很重要嗎？無論是不是同族，我都不會便宜你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次我去見你的時候，記得做好格子餅招待我哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g1_monasteryentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "物資運輸隊馬上就要到了，補充燃料之後，修道院就能啟動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，雖說這次的外勤工作地點離拉特蘭城沒那麼遠，但事件還挺棘手的。是不是應該借張修道院的床睡一覺休息一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼沒看出來你耗費了很多精力，里凱萊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是一直在假裝什麼都不知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說我該感謝你至少沒偷懶把那些與深海教會相關的證據直接倒進下水道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼嚴格啊，奧倫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個薩卡茲雇傭兵的案宗，費德里科肯定比我記得更清楚，深海教會的事情，你和蕾繆安瞭解過的案例肯定也比我更多嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，你有沒有覺得你開始排斥共感之後，我們勉強能合作了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎麼突然提起這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，就是覺得有時候對別人少瞭解一點也挺好的，就像射擊的時候得閉上一隻眼睛那樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，不過我還是要說明一下，蕾繆安叫我們排查修道院與深海教會還有沒有聯繫，這項任務我是認真執行了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從結果來說，確實可以安心睡一覺吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算你......不，算我們運氣好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "修道院接受補給之後能順利回歸拉特蘭，裡面的居民也沒怎麼被驚動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個墮天的女孩跟著薩卡茲走了，日後如果有必要，拉特蘭能找到她，也能定位這群薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總體來說，拉特蘭的外交形象不會受到多大影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種好事可不是天天都能有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g1_monasteryentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我祈禱過了，希望我們去拉特蘭這一路足夠順利，沒有強盜來找我們麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要到了拉特蘭城裡面，我們的日子應該就沒什麼可擔心的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想應該是吧？那些拉特蘭來的使者看起來不怎麼餓肚子，衣服也都是嶄新的，真羡慕啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說，他們是用什麼辦法種地的？還是說他們會給每人配一把銃，大家都去打獵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰知道呢，我反正想像不出來。要是不用花那麼多時間修補房子、拼湊工具......我都不知道閒下來該做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至有點發抖，說不上來是太激動還是害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那就祈禱吧。不管怎麼說，信仰肯定是能保佑我們的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g1_monasteryentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，我覺得至少我們盡力了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於最後會不會發生好事，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾倫戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大哥哥，你知不知道，媽媽去哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，小孩子？唔，難道不是所有人都聚集在這附近嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾倫戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽媽不在......但是昨天晚上媽媽有回來哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾絲塔拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，媽媽昨晚給我們帶了禮物，我們借給一個睡著的叔叔了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡著的叔叔......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！叔叔睡得可香了，一定是在做什麼美夢吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建於一塊移動地塊上的修道院，在擱淺十數年，與一片土地幾乎融為一體之後，重新動起來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很壯觀的景象。破滅與新生在此交會，令人印象深刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看起來情緒不佳。如果有哪裡不適，還請不要忍耐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟你的身體還沒有完全轉變到最好的狀態......我的同胞，接下來的路程會比較辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些拉特蘭人，他們會善待那兩個孩子嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想會的。拉特蘭的現任教宗是個溫和派，如果沒有意外，兩個孩子今後應該會被合適的人家收養，就這樣在拉特蘭長大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有那位墮天使小姐跟著，還有那幾位教皇廳的薩科塔關注，你的那些同族應該也不會被事後暗中清算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，您說錯了一點，奧盧斯......主教閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經，不是他們的同族了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你如此認為，那麼這便會是事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，擱淺於曠野的樂園已逝，我們也該啟程了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再次......歡迎你的加入，赫曼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g7_chapel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您接下來打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如我這樣的罪人，還有選擇的餘地嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然說是有過主觀上的加害意圖，但是從最後的結局來看，您並沒有造成什麼實質上的損害......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我個人是覺得沒有問題的，不過事情和伊比利亞有關，或許薇爾麗芙那邊會比較嚴厲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......您本人看起來好像無法接受這種說辭呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......特使閣下，我需先為這段時間的無禮向您表達歉意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能感受到您的心意，我接受您的道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同時，我也能感覺到......您真正想說的並不是這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......對自我的宣判不是一件易事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一度沉淪於絕望，向心中的惡意垂首，這是不容否認，也不該忽視的事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個嘛，要說懷抱著善意的傷害，和沒有付諸行動的惡意，究竟哪一種更應該得到懲戒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認為是前者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一道念頭出現於我們的腦海，有時只是一閃而過，有時卻是潛伏於深處，默默紮根，靜待發芽之時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今這般結果，您又如何知曉這不會僅僅只是一次動搖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若我今日選了另一條路，特使閣下，現如今此處又會是什麼模樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不敢說我已剔除了深種於腦中的那些妄念，我甚至不敢說......我還信著我們的“條律”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但您仍能感受到它，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我仍然能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我時刻祈禱，祈求人們能夠在這裡得到他們應得的，祈求這偏居一隅的一方樂園不至於在我掌中分崩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可實在是等了太久了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太久了。久到我開始質疑，或許信仰的存在，只不過是自我施加的一場欺騙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是怎樣一種感覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕望、恐懼、悲傷......還有什麼？這種情緒是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是荒謬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們要怎麼做到，去懷疑一個存在於自身腦海裡的東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那意味著你已經開始懷疑你自己......這份懷疑若是無法得到驅散，會是很可怕的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若信仰可以是虛假的，斯特凡諾此人的存在，又有幾分真實？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想要去理解，我嘗試去理解......但是，看來是我高估了自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們沒法完全理解另一個人，儘管有著共感這種作弊一樣的能力，“理解”卻仍然如此昂貴，如此艱難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是呢，在真切地經歷過許多事之後，我現在覺得就算沒有共感，仍然有許多情感能夠在人與人之間傳達，並被多數的人所理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少我可以說，現在的我確實稍微瞭解了一點某個人的想法，不是因為我感覺到了什麼，而是因為我親身體會過了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，現在我該把這個借給您，斯特凡諾閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個曾經在此借住過的修士的筆記，但是我想，或許您會想要看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個人......或許也和閣下一樣，想過很多問題，擁有很多煩惱呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特使閣下，您方才問我，打算怎麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我會回答您。我會去拉特蘭——但不是和他人一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的意思是......要獨自一人，從這裡出發回到拉特蘭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像您這樣的老人家，這恐怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要阻攔。我需確認，我需......尋回我的信仰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若有朝一日償清我的罪過，若當真有奇蹟，或許我便可以找回我的拉特蘭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，我祝福您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我祝福您能找到自己想要的答案。斯特凡諾閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會於那處樂園再會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人沒有再說話。\n眼前的人實在太過衰老了，在經歷了那樣的一夜後，對方的蒼老越來越填滿面上每一道縫隙。\n在蕾繆安的注視下，斯特凡諾·托雷格羅薩略微佝僂著背脊，緩慢地走出了面前的大門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執行者費德里科，現進行任務彙報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相關情況如之前所述，兩名特使的生存狀態已確認。兩人狀態良好，無性命之憂，不日將回到拉特蘭述職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安布羅修修道院擬重新啟動，將按計劃重新規劃航線，目的地設定為拉特蘭近郊，預定將於來年春天之前到達目標地點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為確保移動地塊穩定運行，及滿足居民生存需求，現已向教皇廳發出物資援助申請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "修道院內居民共一百五十三人，其中四十一名將於近日自修道院啟程離開，其動向將由斯普莉雅負責追蹤記錄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "是你說的那些薩卡茲，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "必須要承認，雖然早有預感，但這次的事態還是有些出乎我的意料......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "不論是修道院內的狀態，還是深海教會的動向，以及阿爾圖羅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你做得很好。這次辛苦你了，費德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。我並未能夠完成閣下的委託。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的介入促使修道院內狀態惡化，未能達到當初維持穩定的任務目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人員傷亡......共三名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你聽起來心懷疑慮，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果面前有一項錯誤的行為，那麼我可以糾正它。如果任務的對象是一名罪人，我有多種方法能夠將其攔下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在本次任務中，我無法找到這樣明確可以執行的階段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不存在錯誤的環節，那麼為何無法得出最優的結局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的條律是否能夠適用於所有情況？如果不能，我該依據什麼來進行接下來的行動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對此懷有疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我無法回答你，費德里科，因為這同樣也是困擾我的問題之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "但我感到很高興......我很高興你能夠開始提出這些問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白您的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "不用著急，你已經開始思考一些從前從未考慮過的問題，這是一個很大的突破，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "就像是拔掉了一瓶陳釀的瓶塞，最艱難的部分已經結束，剩下要做的，只是把你想要的東西從瓶口傾倒出來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "而我現在，正要去拜訪一位朋友，我想你應該也對他並不那麼陌生，我會把你的疑問也一併帶給他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "屆時，我將與你共享他給出的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高大的聖像在眾人身後保持緘默，清晨的光從外側向內傾瀉，執行者掛斷通訊，若有所覺地抬起頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g1_monasteryentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "熹微晨光下，年老的薩科塔漸行漸遠，背影在光中緩緩溶解。\n站在門前目送其離去的蕾繆安忽然有所預感。\n眼前的這一幕，或許並不會是她最後一次見到這位老人。\n就像對方親口說的那樣——\n或許他真的能夠，找到他想要的那個拉特蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
